# Quick Reference: Manual Drawing Workflow (v3.2)

## Step-by-Step Guide for Drawing Strata

### 📝 STEP 1: Enter Stratum Name

**Option A - Use IPCC Tier 1 Preset:**
```
Click dropdown → Select ecosystem type
Examples:
- High-Marsh
- Low-Marsh
- Seagrass-Dense
- Seagrass-Sparse
- Generic-Blue-Carbon
```

**Option B - Enter Custom Name:**
```
Type in text box → e.g., "Mixed Marsh"
```

---

### 🖊️ STEP 2: Start Drawing

```
Click: [🖊️ Start Drawing Polygon]
```

**What happens:**
- ✓ Drawing mode activates on map
- ✓ "Start Drawing" button becomes disabled (grayed out)
- ✓ "Finish & Add This Stratum" button becomes enabled (green)
- ✓ Status shows: "🎨 Drawing active: Click on map to place vertices..."

---

### 🗺️ STEP 3: Draw on Map

**Controls:**
- **Single click** = Place vertex (corner point)
- **Double-click** = Complete polygon shape
- **Drag** = Pan map while drawing

**Tips:**
- At least 3 vertices required for a polygon
- Can create complex shapes with many vertices
- Double-click when ready to finish shape
- Shape will appear on map when complete

---

### ✓ STEP 4: Finalize Stratum

```
Click: [✓ Finish & Add This Stratum]
```

**What happens:**
- ✓ Geometry validated and added to strata list
- ✓ Success message shows in green
- ✓ Polygon appears on map with unique color
- ✓ Stratum name cleared (ready for next)
- ✓ "Start Drawing" button re-enabled
- ✓ "Finish & Add" button disabled again

---

## 🔄 Repeat for Additional Strata

### Same Stratum, Multiple Polygons:
1. Keep the same name
2. Draw another polygon
3. Click "Finish & Add"
4. Repeat as needed

### Different Stratum:
1. Enter new stratum name
2. Draw polygon
3. Click "Finish & Add"
4. Repeat as needed

---

## ✅ When All Strata Are Drawn

```
Click: [✓ Finalize Strata & Calculate Areas]
```

This completes Step 1 and moves you to Step 2 (Carbon Priors).

---

## 🎨 Visual Indicators

| Status | Start Button | Finish Button | Status Color |
|--------|--------------|---------------|--------------|
| Ready to draw | Enabled | Disabled | - |
| Drawing active | Disabled | Enabled | 🔵 Blue |
| Stratum added | Enabled | Disabled | 🟢 Green |
| Error occurred | Enabled | Disabled | 🟠 Orange |

---

## ⚠️ Common Issues & Solutions

### "No geometry drawn" error
**Cause**: Clicked "Finish" before completing polygon  
**Solution**: Make sure to double-click to complete shape first

### "No stratum name specified" error
**Cause**: Forgot to enter/select stratum name  
**Solution**: Enter name in Step 1 before clicking "Start Drawing"

### Shape not appearing on map
**Cause**: Didn't click "Finish & Add This Stratum" button  
**Solution**: After double-clicking to complete shape, remember to click the green "Finish" button

### Can't start new drawing
**Cause**: Previous drawing still active  
**Solution**: Click "Finish & Add" to complete current stratum first

---

## 📊 Example Session

```
User wants to create 3 strata: High-Marsh, Low-Marsh, Seagrass-Dense

Step 1: High-Marsh (2 polygons)
  1a. Select "High-Marsh" from dropdown
  1b. Click "Start Drawing Polygon"
  1c. Draw first polygon → double-click to complete
  1d. Click "Finish & Add This Stratum"
  
  1e. Keep "High-Marsh" selected (or re-select)
  1f. Click "Start Drawing Polygon"
  1g. Draw second polygon → double-click to complete
  1h. Click "Finish & Add This Stratum"

Step 2: Low-Marsh (1 polygon)
  2a. Select "Low-Marsh" from dropdown
  2b. Click "Start Drawing Polygon"
  2c. Draw polygon → double-click to complete
  2d. Click "Finish & Add This Stratum"

Step 3: Seagrass-Dense (1 polygon)
  3a. Select "Seagrass-Dense" from dropdown
  3b. Click "Start Drawing Polygon"
  3c. Draw polygon → double-click to complete
  3d. Click "Finish & Add This Stratum"

Result: 3 strata with 4 total polygons

Final Step: Click "Finalize Strata & Calculate Areas"
```

---

## 🎯 Key Takeaways

✅ **Always enter name first** before starting to draw  
✅ **Double-click** to complete polygon shape  
✅ **Must click "Finish & Add"** button to save stratum  
✅ **Can add multiple polygons** to same stratum  
✅ **Each stratum gets unique color** on map  
✅ **Status messages guide you** through workflow  

---

## 🔧 Troubleshooting

**Problem**: Nothing happens when I click "Start Drawing"  
**Check**: Did you enter a stratum name first?

**Problem**: "Finish & Add" button is grayed out  
**Check**: Did you click "Start Drawing" first?

**Problem**: Polygon disappeared after drawing  
**Check**: Did you click "Finish & Add This Stratum"?

**Problem**: Strata list shows "None"  
**Check**: Have you completed the "Finish & Add" step?

